  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "MOFA 的输入描述允许各数据矩阵来自相同或重叠的样本集合，因此它并不要求两个 view 的样本必须完全一一对应。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 cell_identity_link=none 表示两个 view 之间没有细胞身份对应关系，这属于样本集合完全不重叠的情况，而不是文档中描述的相同或重叠样本。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:cell_identity_link"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "现有证据只说明 MOFA 适用于相同或重叠样本，没有给出任意缺失或不重叠样本下的兼容性规则，因此不能据此断言你的两个队列可以直接用于该模型。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个 view 的样本集合是否至少存在部分重叠，或者你是否有可用的样本对应关系表？",
    "missing_field": "sample_overlap_or_linkage",
    "why_needed": "MOFA 的输入描述针对相同或重叠样本；在 cell_identity_link=none 且两个队列分别来自 cohort A 和 cohort B 的情况下，需要确认是否存在重叠样本或可建立的对应关系，才能判断该用法是否落在已描述范围内。"
  }
}
